# The demo video is hosted outside Git (the assignment says: do not commit video files). These lines keep a video from being added by accident.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.m4v
*.webm
*.mkv
*.avi

# bundle/ (the trained models and the replay file, made by "make export-bundle") is NOT ignored on purpose: the workflow that builds the
# images reads it from the repository (.github/workflows/nlp-pipeline-images.yml). The model is 6.7 MB, and GitHub refuses files above 100 MB; export-nlp-bundle.py prints the size of every file it writes.
